DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     aahhdd provides access to the SCSI bus(es) connected to Adaptec AIC79xx host
     adapter chips.

     aahhdd supports narrow and wide buses; synchronous and asynchronous opera‐
     tion; fast, ultra, ultra2, ultra160, and ultra320 (packetized) transfers;
     tagged queuing and 512 SCBs.

     aahhdd does not support target mode operation.

     The aahhdd driver supports the following:

           ••   Adaptec AIC7901 host adapter chip
           ••   Adaptec AIC7901A host adapter chip
           ••   Adaptec AIC7902 host adapter chip
           ••   Adaptec 29320 host adapter
           ••   Adaptec 39320 host adapter
           ••   Many motherboards with on-board SCSI support

